still want her?

530
01:05:18.799 --> 01:05:20.240
It's gonna be
dark soon.

531
01:05:20.240 --> 01:05:21.042
We can't track
them at night.

532
01:05:21.042 --> 01:05:22.363
they'll see us coming.

533
01:05:23.645 --> 01:05:27.650
We'll drive right past
them and never know it.

534
01:05:27.650 --> 01:05:28.652
He's right.

535
01:05:29.133 --> 01:05:33.498
They're on foot. Tired.
They'll have to sleep.

536
01:05:35.181 --> 01:05:37.224
We'll make up the
ground tomorrow.

537
01:05:37.224 --> 01:05:39.386
We'll have them
before morning. Sam.

538
01:05:40.868 --> 01:05:44.032
That better be
a guarantee.

539
01:06:00.414 --> 01:06:03.297
Do you really read the
same book every day?

540
01:06:03.297 --> 01:06:04.579
Without fail.

541
01:06:08.745 --> 01:06:10.908
Will you read
some to me?

542
01:06:13.511 --> 01:06:14.793
Please.

543
01:06:20.120 --> 01:06:27.088
The lord is my shepard.
I shall not want;

544
01:06:27.088 --> 01:06:32.416
He makes me to lie down
in green pastures.

545
01:06:32.416 --> 01:06:35.740
He leads me beside
still waters;

546
01:06:35.740 --> 01:06:39.505
He restores my soul.

547
01:06:39.505 --> 01:06:42.630
He leadeth me in paths
of righteousness

548
01:06:42.630 --> 01:06:43.911
for His name's sake.

549
01:06:47.956 --> 01:06:49.238
Even though I walk
through the valley

550
01:06:49.238 --> 01:06:51.802
of the shadow
of death.

551
01:06:51.802 --> 01:06:54.845
I will fear no evil;

552
01:06:54.845 --> 01:06:55.847
for Thou art with me

553
01:06:57.409 --> 01:07:00.413
- That's beautiful.
- You like that?

554
01:07:00.413 --> 01:07:03.697
- Did you write that?
- Yes I did.

555
01:07:03.697 --> 01:07:07.061
- Really?
- No.

556
01:07:08.623 --> 01:07:10.466
That was around
a long time before

557
01:07:10.466 --> 01:07:13.109
you and I got here.
thats for sure.

558
01:07:18.636 --> 01:07:20.199
What did you mean
when you said it's

559
01:07:20.199 --> 01:07:21.480
not just any book?

560
01:07:32.255 --> 01:07:33.577
It's the only one.

561
01:07:36.300 --> 01:07:37.782
Really?

562
01:07:37.782 --> 01:07:39.624
After the war people
made it their business

563
01:07:39.624 --> 01:07:43.910
to find and destroy any
that the fires didn't get.

564
01:07:43.910 --> 01:07:44.991
some people say this
was the reason

565
01:07:44.991 --> 01:07:46.553
for the war in
the first place.

566
01:07:49.076 --> 01:07:53.483
Anyway. it's the only
one that survived.

567
01:07:55.766 --> 01:07:57.728
How did you get it?

568
01:08:02.855 --> 01:08:07.461
They said that the war.
tore a hole in the sky.

569
01:08:07.461 --> 01:08:09.063
You probably
heard the stories.

570
01:08:09.063 --> 01:08:10.064
Yeah.

571
01:08:10.744 --> 01:08:15.030
Tore a hole in the sky.
sun came down.

572
01:08:15.030 --> 01:08:16.552
and burned everything.

573
01:08:17.113 --> 01:08:19.437
Everything and
everybody.

574
01:08:19.837 --> 01:08:21.959
You were lucky. to
hole up and hide in

575
01:08:21.959 --> 01:08:25.004
a place like this.
or underground.

576
01:08:26.926 --> 01:08:28.929
Most people
weren't lucky.

577
01:08:32.333 --> 01:08:36.379
So. a year later we
started coming out.

578
01:08:36.379 --> 01:08:40.024
wandering around.
didn't know what to do.

579
01:08:40.024 --> 01:08:43.949
just trying to find a
place to survive.

580
01:08:44.510 --> 01:08:49.476
One day. I heard a voice.
It's hard to explain.

581
01:08:49.476 --> 01:08:55.284
but it was like if it was
coming from inside me.

582
01:08:55.284 --> 01:09:00.130
But I could hear it as
clear as I can hear you.

583
01:09:00.130 --> 01:09:02.533
What did the voice say?

584
01:09:02.533 --> 01:09:07.940
It led me. To a place
where I found the book.

585
01:09:07.940 --> 01:09:11.025
Buried. under some rubble.

586
01:09:13.948 --> 01:09:19.076
The voice told me to
carry the book out West.

587
01:09:19.076 --> 01:09:22.800
It told me a path had
been laid out for me.

588
01:09:22.800 --> 01:09:26.605
that I'd be led to a
place where the book

589
01:09:26.605 --> 01:09:27.926
would be safe.

590
01:09:31.291 --> 01:09:34.736
Told me that I'd
be protected.

591
01:09:34.736 --> 01:09:40.463
against anything that
stood in my path.

592
01:09:41.384 --> 01:09:43.908
I've been walking
ever since.

593
01:09:45.389 --> 01:09:46.511
And you did all that
because a voice

594
01:09:46.511 --> 01:09:48.674
in your head told
you to.

595
01:09:49.916 --> 01:09:51.678
Yes. I did.

596
01:09:51.959 --> 01:09:56.764
I know what I heard.
I know what I hear.

597
01:09:57.765 --> 01:10:01.050
And I know I would
have never made it.

598
01:10:01.050 --> 01:10:02.973
without help.

599
01:10:03.453 --> 01:10:06.417
- What's that?
- One question too many.

600
01:10:06.417 --> 01:10:08.941
Go to bed. we've got an
early start in the morning.

601
01:11:11.903 --> 01:11:13.866
What are you doing?

602
01:11:13.866 --> 01:11:15.348
I'm sorry. I thought
you were sleeping.

603
01:11:15.348 --> 01:11:18.992
I wasn't sleeping.
What are you doing?

604
01:11:18.992 --> 01:11:20.514
I just wanted to
see the book.

605
01:11:20.514 --> 01:11:24.120
Nobody touches it but
me. you understand?

606
01:11:24.120 --> 01:11:28.366
- Do you understand me?
- Yes. I understand.

607
01:11:38.417 --> 01:11:39.740
since you don't know
how to read anyway.

608
01:11:39.740 --> 01:11:41.462
it's of no use to you.

609
01:11:41.462 --> 01:11:42.743
Yeah.

610
01:11:43.745 --> 01:11:45.788
So teach me.

611
01:12:05.414 --> 01:12:07.738
Hold on. Hold up.
Stop!

612
01:12:13.705 --> 01:12:16.708
You say you've been
walking for 30 years.

613
01:12:17.470 --> 01:12:19.232
Have you ever thought
maybe you were lost?

614
01:12:19.232 --> 01:12:20.513
No.

615
01:12:20.553 --> 01:12:22.796
How do you know you're
walking in the right direction?

616
01:12:22.796 --> 01:12:25.440
I walk by faith.
not by sight.

617
01:12:26.481 --> 01:12:29.005
- What does that mean?
- It means you know something.

618
01:12:29.005 --> 01:12:31.368
even if you don't
know something.

619
01:12:31.368 --> 01:12:32.489
It doesn't make
any sense.

620
01:12:32.489 --> 01:12:35.293
It doesn't have to
make sense. It's faith.

621
01:12:35.293 --> 01:12:37.856
Its a flower of light.
in a field of darkness.

622
01:12:37.856 --> 01:12:40.099
giving me the strength
to carry on. understand?

623
01:12:40.099 --> 01:12:41.582
Is that from
your book?

624
01:12:41.582 --> 01:12:46.188
No. it's Johnny Cash...

625
01:12:46.188 --> 01:12:47.509
What?

626
01:13:09.898 --> 01:13:12.142
Do you think anyone
lives there?

627
01:13:12.142 --> 01:13:13.464
I dont know.

628
01:13:14.866 --> 01:13:16.748
Maybe there's water.

629
01:13:26.600 --> 01:13:28.162
Stay behind me.

630
01:13:30.646 --> 01:13:33.330
"No Trespassers"

631
01:13:33.330 --> 01:13:35.292
This is weird.

632
01:14:10.098 --> 01:14:11.299
Who are you?

633
01:14:15.384 --> 01:14:18.109
Travelers. thats all.
Don't mean any harm.

634
01:14:18.109 --> 01:14:21.433
No trespassing. Didn't
you read the sign?

635
01:14:21.433 --> 01:14:23.876
We're very sorry.
I didn't see it.

636
01:14:24.758 --> 01:14:26.240
- What's your business?
- We were just...

637
01:14:26.240 --> 01:14:28.322
No business.

638
01:14:28.322 --> 01:14:30.445
We're very sorry.
and if you let us.

639
01:14:30.445 --> 01:14:32.327
we'll be on our way.

640
01:14:32.327 --> 01:14:34.249
George. look at them.

641
01:14:34.249 --> 01:14:36.492
One of them is
just a girl.

642
01:14:36.492 --> 01:14:39.817
Old story. Heard it a
hundred times before.

643
01:14:39.817 --> 01:14:41.739
We get so few
visitors these days.

644
01:14:41.739 --> 01:14:44.423
George is suspicious
of everybody.

645
01:14:44.423 --> 01:14:46.266
I'm Martha.

646
01:14:46.266 --> 01:14:48.589
Would you care
for some tea?

647
01:14:58.882 --> 01:15:02.568
How about some music?
It's so soothing.

648
01:15:02.568 --> 01:15:03.849
George!

649
01:15:16.705 --> 01:15:23.715
<i>You can ring my bell.
ring my bell.</i>

650
01:15:23.715 --> 01:15:24.996
How do you like it?

651
01:15:31.605 --> 01:15:37.854
<i>You can ring my bell.
ring my bell.</i>

652
01:15:37.854 --> 01:15:40.616
- Is that good?
- Good. good.

653
01:15:41.217 --> 01:15:42.539
Great.

654
01:15:46.784 --> 01:15:48.747
It's amazing that you
two have survived

655
01:15:48.747 --> 01:15:50.509
out here all by
yourselves.

656
01:15:50.509 --> 01:15:54.274
Well. now. George is
something of a handyman.

657
01:15:56.118 --> 01:15:57.680
He did a lot of
work on this place.

658
01:15:57.680 --> 01:15:59.362
making it safe.

659
01:15:59.362 --> 01:16:02.165
We may be old. but
we're resilliant.

660
01:16:02.846 --> 01:16:04.528
We've had more than
a few trying to take

661
01:16:04.528 --> 01:16:06.851
this place from us.
haven't we George?

662
01:16:06.851 --> 01:16:08.574
Yes we have.

663
01:16:08.854 --> 01:16:10.737
I wanna show you
something. come on.

664
01:16:10.737 --> 01:16:13.661
George. no. Not now.

665
01:16:13.982 --> 01:16:15.262
Come on!

666
01:16:18.065 --> 01:16:20.589
- Are these...?
- Graves? Sure.

667
01:16:20.589 --> 01:16:22.832
It'd be uncivilized
not to bury them.

668
01:16:22.832 --> 01:16:25.996
Besides. it's good
for the soil.

669
01:16:25.996 --> 01:16:27.639
Come on back inside.

670
01:16:27.639 --> 01:16:29.882
I might be able to rustle
up some sandwhiches.

671
01:16:29.882 --> 01:16:32.044
Well. thank you. Thank
you very much.

672
01:16:32.044 --> 01:16:33.927
- We gotta go now.
- They killed these people.

673
01:16:33.927 --> 01:16:35.329
They didn't just kill
them. They ate them.

674
01:16:35.329 --> 01:16:37.292
- Their hands are shaking.
- Too much human meat.

675
01:16:37.292 --> 01:16:38.613
Let's go.

676
01:16:38.613 --> 01:16:41.818
I found some meat.
I hope you're hungry.

677
01:16:41.818 --> 01:16:43.340
No. No. thank you.

678
01:16:43.340 --> 01:16:47.145
- Well. we gotta be going.
- So soon?

679
01:16:47.145 --> 01:16:48.627
Yeah. I'm afraid so.

680
01:16:48.627 --> 01:16:50.027
Are you sure you
won't stay?

681
01:16:50.027 --> 01:16:53.192
I'm sure. Very sure.
Put the gun down.

682
01:16:53.192 --> 01:16:56.116
Sorry. Take this. Open
the door for us. please.

683
01:16:56.677 --> 01:16:59.240
- Thank you for the tea.
- Thank you so much.

684
01:17:06.570 --> 01:17:07.971
Go back inside.

685
01:17:12.177 --> 01:17:13.139
George. what's wrong?

686
01:17:13.139 --> 01:17:15.622
Whole company of armed
degenerats. thats what.

687
01:17:15.622 --> 01:17:18.065
and they led them
straight to us.

688
01:17:18.065 --> 01:17:19.627
I just set out the
good china.

689
01:17:19.627 --> 01:17:20.749
Fuck the china.

690
01:17:20.749 --> 01:17:22.231
Have you got any
more weapons?

691
01:17:22.231 --> 01:17:25.554
Weapons? I'll show
you some weapons.

692
01:17:32.404 --> 01:17:33.765
Come on.

693
01:17:33.765 --> 01:17:36.129
We know you're
in there.

694
01:17:37.211 --> 01:17:40.615
Come on out and nobody
needs to get hurt.

695
01:17:44.580 --> 01:17:46.783
I'll make it easy.

696
01:17:46.783 --> 01:17:49.747
Send out Solara
with the book.

697
01:17:49.747 --> 01:17:50.668
What are we
gonna do?

698
01:17:50.668 --> 01:17:52.471
I know what the
fuck I'm doing.

699
01:17:52.471 --> 01:17:54.073
Wait. wait.

700
01:17:59.119 --> 01:18:01.281
They ain't coming out.

701
01:18:27.036 --> 01:18:30.281
Shit! Get down!
Everybody down!

702
01:18:49.906 --> 01:18:51.828
You know that
voice you heard?

703
01:18:51.869 --> 01:18:53.511
Did he say anything
about this?

704
01:18:53.831 --> 01:18:56.235
We'll get out alive.
Both of us.

705
01:18:56.235 --> 01:18:57.556
What about us?

706
01:18:58.638 --> 01:19:00.200
Didn't mention you.

707
01:19:09.571 --> 01:19:10.853
Cease fire!

708
01:19:11.694 --> 01:19:12.976
Cease fire.

709
01:19:25.232 --> 01:19:27.275
Motherfuckers!

710
01:19:32.922 --> 01:19:36.407
<i>Over on the side!
Over on the side!</i>

711
01:19:39.251 --> 01:19:40.853
Fucking bastards!

712
01:19:45.859 --> 01:19:47.261
Hold your fire!

713
01:19:47.902 --> 01:19:50.545
- What are they doing?
- Nothing good.

714
01:21:05.164 --> 01:21:06.646
Where is the book?

715
01:21:13.535 --> 01:21:15.217
Check his pack.

716
01:21:33.721 --> 01:21:35.043
It ain't here.

717
01:21:37.967 --> 01:21:41.091
This is your last chance.
You give it up. or

718
01:21:41.091 --> 01:21:43.494
I swear I'll bury
you out here.

719
01:21:53.868 --> 01:21:57.873
Son-of-a...
Let's try this again.

720
01:22:02.238 --> 01:22:04.401
- Carnegie!
- What!?

721
01:22:14.255 --> 01:22:18.701
Now. Where's the book?

722
01:22:22.826 --> 01:22:25.469
Give him the book.
Please.

723
01:22:29.835 --> 01:22:31.798
Don't tell him.

724
01:22:41.370 --> 01:22:44.494
It's in the house.
Back of the TV.

725
01:22:45.816 --> 01:22:49.421
- Go check the TV.
- The what?

726
01:22:49.781 --> 01:22:52.105
You gotta be fucking
shitting me. You go!

727
01:22:52.865 --> 01:22:54.187
Go!

728
01:23:29.914 --> 01:23:33.760
Ask and you
shall receive.

729
01:23:38.565 --> 01:23:40.929
God is good.
is he not?

730
01:23:42.171 --> 01:23:43.452
All the time.

731
01:23:45.815 --> 01:23:47.617
Not all the time.

732
01:24:14.894 --> 01:24:16.215
No!

733
01:25:01.395 --> 01:25:06.521
You see? What
did I tell you?

734
01:25:12.890 --> 01:25:14.812
He's just a man.

735
01:25:18.056 --> 01:25:21.341
No! Leave him alone!

736
01:25:29.551 --> 01:25:31.874
Where's your
protection now?

737
01:25:33.317 --> 01:25:34.598
Hmm?

738
01:25:46.734 --> 01:25:48.537
Pray for me.

739
01:25:51.781 --> 01:25:53.063
Okay?

740
01:25:57.548 --> 01:25:59.151
I mean it.

741
01:27:26.105 --> 01:27:27.386
Shit.

742
01:27:28.868 --> 01:27:30.191
Go back!

743
01:28:13.968 --> 01:28:16.411
Come on.
Come on!

744
01:29:15.969 --> 01:29:17.412
We've got enough
fuel to make it back.

745
01:29:17.412 --> 01:29:19.054
do you want to
go after her?

746
01:29:21.137 --> 01:29:22.458
No.

747
01:30:43.404 --> 01:30:47.008
- Where are you going?
- I'm going West.

748
01:30:47.008 --> 01:30:47.810
Gotta go West.

749
01:30:50.654 --> 01:30:51.976
Hey.

750
01:31:17.208 --> 01:31:21.093
- I'm sorry.
- For what?

751
01:31:21.093 --> 01:31:22.856
This. This is
all my fault.

752
01:31:22.856 --> 01:31:24.298
- No. it's not.
- Yeah it is.

753
01:31:24.298 --> 01:31:25.339
if I didn't come with
you. none of this

754
01:31:25.339 --> 01:31:26.661
would have happened.

755
01:31:28.663 --> 01:31:31.107
It's not your fault.

756
01:31:32.989 --> 01:31:34.832
Did what I had to do.

757
01:31:34.832 --> 01:31:36.514
Didn't think anything
could make you

758
01:31:36.514 --> 01:31:37.235
give up that book.

759
01:31:43.323 --> 01:31:45.086
You know. for years
I've been carrying and

760
01:31:45.086 --> 01:31:47.008
reading it every day.

761
01:31:49.531 --> 01:31:52.494
I got so caught up
with keeping it safe

762
01:31:52.494 --> 01:31:57.381
I forgot to live by
what I learned from it.

763
01:31:57.902 --> 01:31:59.825
Yeah? What's that?

764
01:32:00.866 --> 01:32:02.708
Just to...

765
01:32:05.152 --> 01:32:08.276
Do for others more than
you do for yourself.

766
01:32:10.639 --> 01:32:13.163
It's what I got
from it anyway.

767
01:32:59.983 --> 01:33:01.466
Do you smell that?

768
01:33:02.547 --> 01:33:05.991
- What?
- In the air. Salt.

769
01:33:10.518 --> 01:33:13.121
We're getting close
to the ocean.

770
01:34:11.998 --> 01:34:13.881
That is good.

771
01:34:15.763 --> 01:34:17.126
That's it.

772
01:34:49.968 --> 01:34:51.811
Get the Engineer!

773
01:36:23.773 --> 01:36:25.575
That's far enough!

774
01:36:26.535 --> 01:36:28.778
What's your
business here?

775
01:36:30.140 --> 01:36:32.063
My name is Eli.

776
01:36:32.663 --> 01:36:35.387
I have a King James
Bible in my possession.

777
01:36:35.387 --> 01:36:37.871
Remain where you are.
Don't attempt to make

778
01:36:37.871 --> 01:36:41.636
any sudden moves. or
you will be fired upon.

779
01:36:58.217 --> 01:37:01.901
Be careful with it.
Thank you.

780
01:37:08.350 --> 01:37:10.233
Careful with it.

781
01:37:20.286 --> 01:37:21.569
Wait.

782
01:37:22.810 --> 01:37:26.415
We've been doing this
for a long time now.

783
01:37:27.936 --> 01:37:31.701
- Feels like a museum.
- It's much more than that.

784
01:37:31.701 --> 01:37:35.027
This is where we're
going to start again.

785
01:37:35.027 --> 01:37:36.547
We've got a printing
press that will be

786
01:37:36.547 --> 01:37:38.951
operational quite soon.

787
01:37:38.951 --> 01:37:40.232
We're going to teach
people about the

788
01:37:40.272 --> 01:37:42.475
world they lost.

789
01:37:42.475 --> 01:37:44.999
Help them start
to rebuild it.

790
01:37:44.999 --> 01:37:47.402
Look. Shakespear.
Britannica.

791
01:37:47.402 --> 01:37:49.524
Missing only a
few volumes.

792
01:37:49.524 --> 01:37:51.848
There's a whole series
of beautiful Mozart

793
01:37:51.848 --> 01:37:55.492
and Wagner records. Still
in very pristine condition.

794
01:37:55.492 --> 01:37:59.178
But never a Bible.
Well. not until now.

795
01:37:59.178 --> 01:38:02.863
May I ask what
condition it's in?

796
01:38:04.144 --> 01:38:08.951
It's beat up. But it
will do the job.

797
01:38:08.951 --> 01:38:11.193
Do you think
I could see it?

798
01:38:11.193 --> 01:38:12.475
Yes. you may.

799
01:38:19.965 --> 01:38:22.689
- That's it. It's open.
- Good.

800
01:38:57.133 --> 01:38:58.496
Do you have anything
to write on?

801
01:38:58.496 --> 01:39:02.141
Could you get us some
writing paper. please?

802
01:39:02.141 --> 01:39:03.422
A lot of it.

803
01:39:05.264 --> 01:39:06.986
A whole lot of it.

804
01:39:07.307 --> 01:39:08.630
It can't be.

805
01:39:16.440 --> 01:39:18.363
It's impossible!

806
01:39:19.683 --> 01:39:21.285
It can't be!

807
01:39:24.169 --> 01:39:26.252
Pay close attention.

808
01:39:26.292 --> 01:39:31.699
And write down
everything I say.

809
01:39:32.581 --> 01:39:36.346
Exactly as I say it.

810
01:39:40.391 --> 01:39:46.879
The first book of Moses.
Called Genesis.

811
01:39:47.560 --> 01:39:51.446
Chapter one.
verse one:

812
01:39:54.649 --> 01:40:01.779
"In the beginning God
created the heavens

813
01:40:01.779 --> 01:40:03.180
and the earth."

814
01:40:07.426 --> 01:40:09.188
Verse two:

815
01:40:11.071 --> 01:40:19.803
"And the earth was
without form and void;

816
01:40:24.248 --> 01:40:31.818
and darkness was upon
the face of the deep.

817
01:40:34.541 --> 01:40:43.073
And the Spirit of God
was hovering

818
01:40:43.073 --> 01:40:46.157
over the face
of the waters."

819
01:40:49.201 --> 01:40:51.765
Verse three:

820
01:40:54.288 --> 01:41:07.064
"And God said. Let
there be light:

821
01:41:07.064 --> 01:41:09.227
and there was light."

822
01:41:19.682 --> 01:41:22.004
Where is Solara?

823
01:41:25.129 --> 01:41:29.455
Out there.
Her choice.

824
01:41:30.095 --> 01:41:35.022
I tried to bring her
back. She refused.

825
01:41:38.145 --> 01:41:40.949
What did you do
when she refused?

826
01:41:46.757 --> 01:41:47.637
Read it.

827
01:41:47.637 --> 01:41:48.880
What did you do
to my daughter?

828
01:41:48.920 --> 01:41:49.841
Read it!

829
01:41:49.841 --> 01:41:52.965
What did you do
to my daughter!?

830
01:42:21.002 --> 01:42:22.324
Sorry.

831
01:42:24.927 --> 01:42:28.051
It's been so long
I dont remember.

832
01:42:35.180 --> 01:42:38.626
- You have to.
- I have to? Really?

833
01:42:38.626 --> 01:42:41.068
You have to. Please.

834
01:42:44.273 --> 01:42:49.839
- Your leg.
- It doesn't hurt anymore.

835
01:42:50.561 --> 01:42:52.523
I can smell it.

836
01:43:07.142 --> 01:43:10.147
You worked so hard
for that book.

837
01:43:10.147 --> 01:43:14.833
You sacrificed so
much. so many men.

838
01:43:16.115 --> 01:43:18.238
More than you
could spare.

839
01:43:20.080 --> 01:43:22.242
Now. all those people
who were too scared

840
01:43:22.242 --> 01:43:25.166
to even say your name.
They're downstairs.

841
01:43:25.166 --> 01:43:28.411
tearing up the bar right
now. did you know that?

842
01:43:29.011 --> 01:43:32.136
And there's noone
there to stop them.

843
01:43:33.096 --> 01:43:35.700
And you are feverish.

844
01:43:37.863 --> 01:43:39.425
I can't imagine what
it must feel like to

845
01:43:39.425 --> 01:43:41.388
have what you want
so close and it might

846
01:43:41.388 --> 01:43:43.631
aswell be a million
miles away.

847
01:43:43.631 --> 01:43:44.912
Stop it!

848
01:43:48.358 --> 01:43:55.286
Are you leaving me?
Claudia?

849
01:43:56.527 --> 01:43:58.529
Claudia!?

850
01:44:01.454 --> 01:44:03.456
Claudia!

851
01:45:51.719 --> 01:45:55.524
Dear Lord. Thank you for
giving me the strength

852
01:45:55.524 --> 01:45:57.327
and the conviction to
complete the task you

853
01:45:57.327 --> 01:45:58.849
entrusted to me.

854
01:46:23.801 --> 01:46:26.926
Thank you for guiding
me straight and true.

855
01:46:26.926 --> 01:46:29.849
through the many
obstacles on my path.

856
01:46:35.456 --> 01:46:37.499
And for keeping me
resolute when all around

857
01:46:37.499 --> 01:46:39.622
seemed lost.

858
01:46:39.983 --> 01:46:41.625
Thank you for your
protection and for your

859
01:46:41.625 --> 01:46:44.429
many signs along
the way.

860
01:46:45.710 --> 01:46:48.434
Thank you for any good
that I may have done.

861
01:46:48.434 --> 01:46:51.677
I'm so sorry
about the bad.

862
01:46:52.319 --> 01:46:53.600
You don't have to
leave. you know.

863
01:46:53.600 --> 01:46:55.803
You're very welcome
to stay here.

864
01:46:55.803 --> 01:46:58.086
You'll be perfectly safe.

865
01:46:58.086 --> 01:47:00.009
Thank you.

866
01:47:00.009 --> 01:47:02.932
But this is something
that I have to do.

867
01:47:07.499 --> 01:47:09.381
Where will you go?

868
01:47:10.503 --> 01:47:11.785
Home.

869
01:47:17.833 --> 01:47:20.076
Thank you for the
friend I made.

870
01:47:20.076 --> 01:47:24.281
Please watch over her.
as you watched over me.

871
01:47:44.667 --> 01:47:48.393
Thank you for finally
allowing me to rest.

872
01:47:48.393 --> 01:47:50.515
I'm so very tired.

873
01:47:50.876 --> 01:47:54.841
But I go now to my
rest at peace.

874
01:47:54.841 --> 01:47:56.764
Knowing that I've done
right with my time

875
01:47:56.764 --> 01:47:58.846
on this earth.

876
01:47:58.846 --> 01:48:03.572
HOLY BIBLE
NEW KING JAMES VERSION

877
01:48:07.538 --> 01:48:13.506
I fought the good fight.
I finished the race.

878
01:48:15.308 --> 01:48:18.152
I kept the faith.

879
01:48:20.338 --> 01:48:23.171
Resynch by UniVerseHub
